    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "?? GROUND FLOOR APARTMENT TO RENT – HOLYWELL GREEN, SWORDS\n\n?? Holywell Green, Swords\n\nA well-presented ground floor apartment in Holywell Green, Swords, which has undergone substantial renovations over the past 2 years.\n\n? Property Features:\n\nGround floor apartment\nAccess to the property from both the front and rear\nDirect access to the communal garden from the rear\nPlenty of parking available directly in front of the house\nBrand-new kitchen\nBrand-new bathroom\nNew carpet in the bedroom\nNew wooden flooring\nBright and well-maintained throughout\nConvenient location close to shops and Tesco\nSchools nearby\nExcellent local amenities and transport links\n\n?? HAP ACCEPTED\n\n?? Viewing: Saturday, 12th September\n?? Available from: Monday, 14th September\n\n?? Please message for further details or to arrange a viewing.\n\nSerious enquiries only, please."
      }
